  <iati-identifier>XM-DAC-7-PPR-4000002586</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-7" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Netherlands</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation costs Fonds Verantwoord Ondernemen (Corporate Responsibility Fund)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the fund to be set up, human rights, labour and environmental risks in the chains of Dutch companies in developing countries can be addressed, in cooperation with civil society organisations and, where possible, local partners. The fund does this by offering support to the implementation phase of IMVO (CSO) covenants and - when there is no IMVO (CSO) covenant in the sector concerned (yet) - by offering support to companies that want to investigate and address abuses in their chain.</narrative>
  </description>
